OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,9,FWilliams, 33, stabbed 10 people on an
OL,10,FLNER train to London as it passed
OL,11,Fthrough Cambridgeshire on 1 November
OL,12,Flast year
OL,14,FHe was also found guilty of four counts
OL,15,Fof attempted murder away from the
OL,16,Ftrain, in Peterborough and London
OL,18,FThe jury initially found Williams
OL,19,Fguilty of seven counts, but hadn't
OL,20,Freached verdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
